*
* COBDISP -- write one line to SYSOUT.
*   R1 -> A(text), A(halfword length).  Opens SYSOUT on demand.
*
COBDISP  STM   14,12,12(13)
         BALR  12,0
         USING *,12
         ST    13,RTSAVE1+4
         LA    11,RTSAVE1
         ST    11,8(13)
         LR    13,11
         L     2,0(0,1)            A(text)
         L     3,4(0,1)            A(length)
         LH    4,0(0,3)            length
